Package: perufaunads004
Title: Taxonomic Validation and Reconciliation of Threatened Fauna of Peru
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Paul E.",
           family = "Santos Andrade",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "paulefrens@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Taxonomic validation and reconciliation of scientific names
    of threatened and legally protected wildlife species in Peru, based on
    Supreme Decree No. 004-2014-MINAGRI
    (MINAGRI, 2014) <https://busquedas.elperuano.pe/normaslegales/decreto-supremo-que-aprueba-la-actualizacion-de-la-lista-de-decreto-supremo-n-004-2014-minagri-1041274-5/>
    and the "Libro Rojo de la Fauna Silvestre Amenazada del Peru"
    (SERFOR, 2018, ISBN:978-612-46908-2-2).
    Provides taxonomic name parsing, a hierarchical matching engine
    (exact, synonym, fuzzy, and genus-level), and structured access to
    conservation technical sheets.
